OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man stabbed in
OL,4,Abusy street
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after another man was stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in Birmingham.
OL,10,FWest Midlands Police said officers were
OL,11,Fcalled just after 13:15 GMT to the
OL,12,Fjunction of Whitmore Road and Coventry
OL,13,FRoad, in the Small Heath area, after a
OL,14,Fman in his 40s sustained knife wounds.
OL,16,FThe force said he was declared dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene and a 46-year-old man was
OL,18,Farrested nearby. He remains in custody
OL,19,Ffor questioning.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
